    "url": "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1WaxvbLx7UoSZaBqdFr1u32F2uWVLo-CJunJB4nlGUE4/htmlview/sheet?gid=1662574278",
    "tab": "Weapon Perks",
    "row": 134,
    "name": "Killing Tally",
    "rawHTML": "<tr style=\"height: 149px\"><th id=\"1662574278R133\" style=\"height: 149px;\"><div style=\"line-height: 149px\">134</div></th><td class=\"s17\">Killing Tally</td><td class=\"s25\"><div style=\"width:70px;height:149px;\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/docsubipk/AP9E6xV0bmhu_rOEBG0ga1V_bdxC9Jr8sY_1lemoyCal7pLGNxIaSPTkaBkdlQ7J4B_meuK_Usp0B65zteT--InlLHWrVtRzBrYyYKlwNahkNTU3skZHJKFwOumCsn2TDura8-PC2VekQjbQG_aBI6zcxaDkXjyLn-Z0zasudA=s149-w70-h149\" style=\"width:inherit;height:inherit;object-fit:scale-down;object-position:center center;pointer-events:none;\"/></div></td><td class=\"s19\" colspan=\"4\"><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;\">On Weapon Kill:<br></span>Grants a stack of Killing Tally, up to 3 stacks. <br><span style=\"font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;\">Stacks are removed on stow or reload.<br><br></span>Killing Tally:<span style=\"font-style:italic;\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#a4c2f4;\">10% | 20% | 30% increased damage<br></span><span style=\"color:#ea9999;\">5% | 10% | 15% increased damage<br></span><span style=\"font-style:italic;\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#ffd966;\">↑Passively grants +10 Magazine Stat </span><span style=\"font-size:7pt;font-weight:normal;font-style:italic;color:#ffd966;\">(Identical to Tactical Mag)</span><span style=\"color:#ffd966;\">.</span></td></tr>",
    "text": "On Weapon Kill: Grants a stack of Killing Tally, up to 3 stacks. Stacks are removed on stow or reload. Killing Tally: 10% | 20% | 30% increased damage 5% | 10% | 15% increased damage ↑Passively grants +10 Magazine Stat (Identical to Tactical Mag) ."
  },
